cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use crypto-service-sdk-cpp in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "crypto-service-sdk-cpp: a typed C++ client for the crypto-server REST API"
abstract: >-
  A C++17 client library for the crypto-server REST API of the Crypto
  Service ecosystem: hashing, MACs, KDFs, AEAD, signatures, post-quantum
  KEMs and signatures, HPKE, KMS and OPAQUE, all computed by the server.
  It is proven against the server by the Crypto Service conformance kit.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
version: "0.0.40"
date-released: "2026-11-16"
# Dual-licensed, at the user's option (LICENSE-APACHE, LICENSE-MIT).
# CFF 1.2.0 takes SPDX licence identifiers, not an SPDX expression; a
# list of several means the work is available under any of them.
license:
  - Apache-2.0
  - MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/crypto-service-sdk-cpp"
url: "https://crypto-service.co"
keywords:
  - cryptography
  - post-quantum
  - REST API
  - C++
  - SDK
